  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Combine flour, malted milk powder, and salt in a bowl.",
    "Add butter and use a pastry blender to mix until crumbly.",
    "Add egg and mix until a dough forms.",
    "Knead the dough for 10 minutes.",
    "Wrap in plastic and refrigerate for 30 minutes.",
    "Roll out the dough and use a cookie cutter to make shapes.",
    "Bake for 20 minutes.",
